     <section anchor="broadcast-alternatives" numbered="true" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-appendix.a">
       <name slugifiedName="name-broadcast-alternatives">Broadcast alternatives</name>
       <t indent="0" pn="section-appendix.a-1">Throughout the development of this memo, there have been a number of
 alternatives explored and discarded for one reason or another.  This
 appendix documents these alternatives and the reason that they were
 not chosen.</t>
